id: pm-vcs-00nv
title: "Refs, HEAD and compare-and-swap branch updates"
description: "Branch and tag storage under refs/, with HEAD either symbolic (ref: refs/heads/main) or a detached object id. Every ref update takes the expected current value and fails if it no longer holds, which is the primitive that lets several agents advance branches in one repository without silently overwriting one another."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
