completed_at: "2026-07-31T06:31:50.465Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: HEAD resolves through a symbolic ref to a commit and reports detached state distinctly; a ref update with a stale expected value fails and leaves the ref untouched; creating a branch that exists fails rather than moving it; deleting the branch HEAD points at is refused
